  "notes": [
    "Review batch L43–L66. Direct native-coordinate crops decoded from pinned JPEG luminance, quantized to four grayscale levels for chat transport. PDF label font Noto Serif, not Monomakh. Original source coordinates allow exact RGB regeneration.",
    "20 uppercase candidate examples, 2 ot-ligature examples, 2 digraph examples. All provisional; explicitly distinguish letters from ligatures and digraphs.",
    "Visual check discarded clipped ot and missed uppercase targets. The candidate Щ crop was actually оу and is labelled accordingly. С/Є, Ꙗ/А and Ѡ/Ꙍ/Ѽ remain visually ambiguous. Context labels are locator hints, not new diplomatic transcriptions."
  ],
